      "content": "hey i feel kinda weird lately. i keep drinking tons of water like all day but i'm still super thirsty and running to the bathroom constantly. also my breath smells kinda sweet?? like fruit or something. i think im just dehydrated or maybe a bit low on electrolytes. what do u think?",
